--TEST--
a cursor on the name in an attribute's own declaration is already at the declaration, so a jump from it answers none, like a class's own name, `rule:attributes/an-attribute-is-declared-with-its-sites`
--FILE--
<?nvs
interface Page {
    attribute Pa<|>th on method { path: string }

    public function render(): string;
}

class Home implements Page {
    #[Path(path: "/")]
    public function render(): string { return "home"; }
}
--REQUEST--
definition
--EXPECT--
none
